{
 "_comment": "AD-073, AD-112: building levels II-VI. Each level rebuilds more of the shell in dearer materials and adds its own equipment (kits); every work building holds one core from level II, and levels III-VI each add a ring to it (III copper, IV iron, V gold, VI netherite), so level VI takes a netherite block through its ring. Kits use only blocks the village's own workshops make: no iron, gold, diamond, emerald, copper or netherite blocks and no redstone machines. Kit cells are placed automatically inside the building; the level a building works at is read from its kits standing in place and the grade of its core. Values weigh items so every next upgrade is dearer.",
